---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="关于" description="为什么叫糖葫芦，以及这里如何挑选每一颗内容。">
  <section class="about-hero" aria-labelledby="about-title">
    <div class="about-hero__copy">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span></span>ABOUT THIS STRING</p>
      <h1 id="about-title">为什么叫<em>糖葫芦？</em></h1>
      <p>因为真正喜欢的东西，不必属于同一种类型。电影、书、工具和一段声音，只要值得，都可以串在一起。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-hero__object" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="about-stick"></span>
      <span class="about-fruit about-fruit--one">看</span>
      <span class="about-fruit about-fruit--two">读</span>
      <span class="about-fruit about-fruit--three">用</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-intro">
    <div class="about-intro__number">01</div>
    <div>
      <p class="section-kicker">这里是什么</p>
      <h2>不是评测，不是导购。<br />是一个人的时间筛选器。</h2>
      <p>这里把官方资料、编辑建议与实际体验分开整理。没有广告，没有付费排名，也不会为了“全面”而把清单塞满。希望每一颗都能替你省下一点选择的力气。</p>
      <div class="about-stats">
        <div><strong id="about-total">—</strong><span>颗收录</span></div>
        <div><strong id="about-categories">—</strong><span>种分类</span></div>
        <div><strong>0</strong><span>广告</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="principles-section" aria-labelledby="principles-title">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="section-kicker">SELECTION RULES</p>
        <h2 id="principles-title">三条不复杂的收录原则</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="principles-grid">
      <article>
        <span>01</span>
        <div class="principle-fruit" aria-hidden="true">尝</div>
        <h3>交代依据</h3>
        <p>区分官方资料、编辑建议与实际体验；来源不足的地方明确标记，不把资料整理写成亲测。</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <span>02</span>
        <div class="principle-fruit" aria-hidden="true">真</div>
        <h3>先说结论</h3>
        <p>尽量告诉你它适合谁、什么时候用，也不回避缺点和门槛。</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <span>03</span>
        <div class="principle-fruit" aria-hidden="true">净</div>
        <h3>没有广告</h3>
        <p>不带货，不卖排名。外部链接只是方便你继续了解，不代表商业合作。</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="process-section" aria-labelledby="process-title">
    <div class="process-section__copy">
      <p class="section-kicker">HOW IT GETS HERE</p>
      <h2 id="process-title">一颗内容，怎么被串进来？</h2>
      <p>不追求更新速度，更在意过一阵子以后，它是不是仍然值得推荐。</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="process-list">
      <li><span>1</span><div><strong>先找依据</strong><p>优先阅读官网、作者或项目资料，记录来源与整理日期。</p></div></li>
      <li><span>2</span><div><strong>再看场景</strong><p>说明内容适合谁、有什么门槛，并删掉缺乏依据的排名与承诺。</p></div></li>
      <li><span>3</span><div><strong>认真写下</strong><p>用一句话说清价值，再补上适合谁、为什么和有什么坑。</p></div></li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <aside class="about-note">
    <span aria-hidden="true">「</span>
    <blockquote>这不是全网最全的清单，只是我留下来的少量答案。希望它也能替你省下一点选择的力气。</blockquote>
    <p>社区评分会匿名汇总；浏览量只用于了解哪些内容被更多人看到。所有内容只代表个人看法，不构成消费建议。</p>

  </aside>

  <section class="about-cta">
    <p class="section-kicker">READY TO PICK ONE?</p>
    <h2>那就从一颗开始吧。</h2>
    <div>
      <a class="button button--primary" href="/">逛逛整串 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      <a class="button button--secondary" href="/search">找一颗值得的</a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <script>
    import { api } from '../scripts/client';
    void api<{ total: number; counts: Record<string, number> }>('/api/stats').then(data => {
      document.querySelector('#about-total')!.textContent = String(data.total);
      document.querySelector('#about-categories')!.textContent = String(Object.keys(data.counts).length);
    }).catch(() => {});
  </script>
</BaseLayout>
